{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
   Am             D6/9    Am7  D6/9   G   Am
My friends tell me              that I've been such a fool,
    Am        D6/9     Am7 D6/9   G         Am  D6/9
And I have to stand by and take   it, baby, all       for loving you.
Am  D6/9         Am7      D6/9   G Am       D6/9
    Drown myself in sorrow            and I look at what you've done,
    Am               D6/9        Am7       D6/9     G
But nothing seems to change, the bad times stay the same
Am    D6/9     Am7
And I can't go on
{end_of_verse}


